#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:17
msgid "What is NeoMixer?"
msgstr "Mis on NeoMixer?"

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:18
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"NeoMixer is a virtual audio mixer and router built on top of PipeWire. It"
" lets you create virtual devices and freely route audio between your "
"inputs and outputs, with volume, mute and an equalizer on the way."
msgstr ""
"NeoMixer on PipeWire’i baasil loodud virtuaalne helimikser ja -ruuter. "
"Selle abil saad luua virtuaalseid seadmeid ning suunata heli vabalt "
"sisendite ja väljundite vahel, reguleerides samal ajal helivaljust ja "
"summutades seda."

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:23
msgid "The four device types"
msgstr "Neli seadmetüüpi"

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:24
msgid ""
"<b>Hardware Inputs</b> are physical sources such as microphones and line-"
"in.\n"
"<b>Virtual Inputs</b> are virtual sinks that applications can play into.\n"
"<b>Hardware Outputs</b> are physical sinks such as speakers and "
"headphones.\n"
"<b>Virtual Outputs</b> are virtual sources that applications can capture "
"from."
msgstr ""
"<b>Riistvaralised sisendid</b> on füüsilised allikad nagu mikrofonid või "
"ühendatud helikaablid..\n"
"<b>Virtuaalsed sisendid</b> on virtuaalsed väljundid, kuhu rakendused "
"saavad heli edastada.\n"
"<b>Riistvaralised väljundid</b> on füüsilised väljundseadmed nagu kõlarid"
" või mikrofonid..\n"
"<b>Virtuaalsed väljundid</b> on virtuaalsed allikad, mille sisendit "
"rakendused saavad kasutada/hõivata.."

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:30
msgid "Routing"
msgstr "Ruuting"

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:31
msgid ""
"Audio always flows from an input to an output: the A and B buttons on "
"each input send its audio to that output. Right click one for its channel"
" mapping and its own volume."
msgstr ""

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:36
msgid "Programs"
msgstr ""

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:37
msgid ""
"Every program that connects to the sound server stays in the list, "
"whether it is playing or not. What you choose for a program is "
"remembered: its streams go to that output whenever it starts, also after "
"a reboot. You can set a program up while it is not running, or add one "
"with the + button before it ever played anything."
msgstr ""

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/eq/eq_window.py:73
#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:43
msgid "Equalizer"
msgstr ""

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:44
msgid ""
"The EQ button on an input opens its parametric equalizer. Drag a band on "
"the curve to change its frequency and gain, scroll to change its width. "
"Switching it off passes the audio through unchanged, so you can compare. "
"Right clicking the EQ button does that without opening the window."
msgstr ""

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:50
msgid "Running in the background"
msgstr ""

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:51
msgid ""
"New streams only go to their remembered output while NeoMixer runs, so "
"closing the window keeps it running with an icon in the tray. Routes and "
"the EQ also keep working after you quit, until you log out. Turn on "
"\"Start at login\" to have all of it from the start."
msgstr ""

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:57
msgid "Primary device"
msgstr "Põhiseade"

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:58
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Marking a device as primary (★) makes it the default that new "
"applications attach to automatically. This sets the primary in PipeWire "
"itself."
msgstr ""
"Seadme põhiliseks märkimine muudab selle vaikimisi seadmeks, millega uued"
" rakendused automaatselt ühenduvad. See määrab põhiseadme PipeWire'is "
"endas."

#: src/neomixer/clients/gtk/widgets/welcome_window.py:63
#, fuzzy
msgid "You can reopen this guide any time from the settings menu."
msgstr ""
"Saad selle juhendi igal ajal uuesti avada seadistuste menüüs olevast "
"teabenupust."

